{"step_index":1326,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T19:45:15Z","thinking":"**Examining Hotkey Functionality**\n\nI've been looking at the hotkeys within the user guide. I see that there are several useful options. There's a set to adjust visibility, ghost mode, and transparency. Some hotkeys allow fine-grained control for stepping up or down on transparency, with individual keys for a set of specific levels, and I have found another one.\n\n\n**Implementing More Hotkeys**\n\nI'm now registering the new hotkeys. I have implemented move window, scrolling, screenshot capture, AI processing, queue reset, preset switching, microphone/universal mute, vision model switching and interview reset. I'm adding all these into `RegisterGlobalHotkeys()`. The setup appears quite streamlined.\n\n\n**Adding Transparency & Presets**\n\nI've added hotkeys for setting specific opacities and stepping transparency up and down. I've also implemented Alt+Q/W/E for switching between primary, secondary, and auto AI presets, and I'm updating the web interface to reflect the change. Added ALT+S for screenshot capture and ALT+P for processing via AI.\n\n\n**Adding More Hotkeys**\n\nI've just added several more hotkeys, each with its own functionality. I can now trigger AI processing with Alt+P and reset the screenshot queue with Alt+R. I've also implemented hotkeys for switching vision models (Alt+T), toggling microphone mute (Alt+M), toggling universal mute (Alt+U), and resetting the interview session (Alt+O).\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Register all hotkeys with Dispatcher safety in MainWindow.xaml.cs.","EndLine":210,"Instruction":"Add full set of hotkeys and Dispatcher invocation in RegisterGlobalHotkeys","ReplacementContent":"        private void RegisterGlobalHotkeys()\n        {\n            // Alt+Z: Toggle Visibility\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.Z, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() => _windowManager.ToggleVisibility());\n            });\n\n            // Alt+X: Toggle Ghost Mode\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.X, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n                {\n                    _windowManager.ToggleGhostMode();\n                    SendJsonToWeb(\"ghost_mode_toggled\", new { is_ghost = _windowManager.IsGhostMode });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Alt+1/2/3: Transparency Presets (Number Row + Numpad)\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.D1, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.40));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.D2, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.70));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.D3, () => SetWindowOpacity(1.00));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.NumPad1, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.40));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.NumPad2, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.70));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.NumPad3, () => SetWindowOpacity(1.00));\n\n            // Alt+[ and Alt+]: Step transparency down/up\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.OemOpenBrackets, () => AdjustTransparency(-0.15));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.OemCloseBrackets, () => AdjustTransparency(+0.15));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.Oem4, () => AdjustTransparency(-0.15));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.Oem6, () => AdjustTransparency(+0.15));\n\n            // Alt+Q/W/E: AI Presets (Primary, Secondary, Auto)\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.Q, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n                {\n                    _sessionController.Llm.ActivePreset = \"primary\";\n                    SendJsonToWeb(\"preset_switched\", new { preset = \"primary\" });\n                });\n            });\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.W, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n                {\n                    _sessionController.Llm.ActivePreset = \"secondary\";\n                    SendJsonToWeb(\"preset_switched\", new { preset = \"secondary\" });\n                });\n            });\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.E, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n                {\n                    _sessionController.Llm.ActivePreset = \"auto\";\n                    SendJsonToWeb(\"preset_switched\", new { preset = \"auto\" });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Alt+S: Capture Screenshot\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.S, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n                {\n                    _sessionController.Vision.CaptureScreen();\n                    SendJsonToWeb(\"screenshot_queued\", new { count = _sessionController.Vision.QueueCount });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Alt+P: Process Screenshots with AI\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.P, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(async () =>\n                {\n                    await _sessionController.ProcessVisionAnalysisAsync(\"\", \"\", new List<string>());\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Alt+R: Reset Screenshot Queue\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.R, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n                {\n                    _sessionController.Vision.ClearQueue();\n                    SendJsonToWeb(\"screenshot_queued\", new { count = 0 });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Alt+T: Switch Vision Model\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.T, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n                {\n                    SendJsonToWeb(\"switch_vision_model\", new { });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Alt+M: Toggle Mic Mute\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.M, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n                {\n                    _sessionController.Audio.IsMuted = !_sessionController.Audio.IsMuted;\n                    SendJsonToWeb(\"mute_state_changed\", new { is_muted = _sessionController.Audio.IsMuted });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Alt+U: Toggle Universal Mute (Pause)\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.U, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n                {\n                    SendJsonToWeb(\"toggle_universal_mute\", new { });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Alt+O: Reset Interview Session\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.O, () =>\n            {\n                Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n                {\n                    _sessionController.ResetSession();\n                    SendJsonToWeb(\"session_reset\", new { status = \"ok\" });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Movement Hotkeys: Alt+I/J/Left/Right\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.I, () => Dispatcher.Invoke(() => _windowManager.MoveWindow(0, -20)));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.J, () => Dispatcher.Invoke(() => _windowManager.MoveWindow(0, 20)));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.Left, () => Dispatcher.Invoke(() => _windowManager.MoveWindow(-20, 0)));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.Right, () => Dispatcher.Invoke(() => _windowManager.MoveWindow(20, 0)));\n\n            // Scroll Hotkeys: Alt+Up/Down\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.Up, () => ScrollWebContent(-100));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.Down, () => ScrollWebContent(100));\n        }\n\n        private void ScrollWebContent(int deltaY)\n        {\n            Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n            {\n                if (WebView != null && WebView.CoreWebView2 != null)\n                {\n                    WebView.CoreWebView2.ExecuteScriptAsync($\"window.scrollBy({{ top: {deltaY}, behavior: 'smooth' }});\");\n                }\n            });\n        }","StartLine":149,"TargetContent":"        private void RegisterGlobalHotkeys()\n        {\n            // Alt+Z: Toggle Visibility\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.Z, () =>\n            {\n                _windowManager.ToggleVisibility();\n            });\n\n            // Alt+X: Toggle Ghost Mode\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.X, () =>\n            {\n                _windowManager.ToggleGhostMode();\n                SendJsonToWeb(\"ghost_mode_toggled\", new { is_ghost = _windowManager.IsGhostMode });\n            });\n\n            // Alt+1/2/3: Transparency Presets (Number Row + Numpad)\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.D1, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.35));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.D2, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.70));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.D3, () => SetWindowOpacity(1.00));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.NumPad1, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.35));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.NumPad2, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.70));\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, Keys.NumPad3, () => SetWindowOpacity(1.00));\n\n            // Alt+[ and Alt+]: Step transparency down/up\n            _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD