{"step_index":1353,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T19:48:00Z","thinking":"**Expanding Hotkey Logic**\n\nOkay, I'm currently expanding the hotkey logic to handle multiple key representations. Specifically, I'm incorporating mappings for various forms of numeric and alphanumeric keys, including Numpad equivalents, to ensure comprehensive hotkey recognition within `MainWindow.xaml.cs`. I'm focusing on handling both direct `Keys` values and their character representations.\n\n\n**Implementing Hotkey Functionality**\n\nI've been occupied with registering more Alt hotkeys and their corresponding actions. I added keys for toggling window visibility and ghost mode, along with keys for adjusting transparency levels and setting AI presets. I've also integrated a screenshot feature via Alt+S, ensuring a robust and versatile set of hotkey options for users. I'm focusing on efficiency and user-friendliness.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Clean and expand RegisterGlobalHotkeys in MainWindow.xaml.cs.","EndLine":250,"Instruction":"Update RegisterGlobalHotkeys with RegisterAlt helper","ReplacementContent":"        private void RegisterGlobalHotkeys()\n        {\n            void RegisterAlt(Keys k, Action a)\n            {\n                _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, k, a);\n            }\n\n            // Alt+Z: Toggle Visibility\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.Z, () => Dispatcher.Invoke(() => _windowManager.ToggleVisibility()));\n\n            // Alt+X: Toggle Ghost Mode\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.X, () => Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n            {\n                _windowManager.ToggleGhostMode();\n                SendJsonToWeb(\"ghost_mode_toggled\", new { is_ghost = _windowManager.IsGhostMode });\n            }));\n\n            // Alt+1/2/3: Transparency Presets\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.D1, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.40));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.D2, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.70));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.D3, () => SetWindowOpacity(1.00));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.NumPad1, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.40));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.NumPad2, () => SetWindowOpacity(0.70));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.NumPad3, () => SetWindowOpacity(1.00));\n\n            // Alt+[ and Alt+]: Step transparency down/up\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.OemOpenBrackets, () => AdjustTransparency(-0.15));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.OemCloseBrackets, () => AdjustTransparency(+0.15));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.Oem4, () => AdjustTransparency(-0.15));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.Oem6, () => AdjustTransparency(+0.15));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.Oemtilde, () => AdjustTransparency(-0.15));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.OemQuotes, () => AdjustTransparency(+0.15));\n\n            // Alt+Q/W/E: AI Presets (Primary, Secondary, Auto)\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.Q, () => Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n            {\n                _sessionController.Llm.ActivePreset = \"primary\";\n                SendJsonToWeb(\"preset_switched\", new { preset = \"primary\" });\n            }));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.W, () => Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n            {\n                _sessionController.Llm.ActivePreset = \"secondary\";\n                SendJsonToWeb(\"preset_switched\", new { preset = \"secondary\" });\n            }));\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.E, () => Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n            {\n                _sessionController.Llm.ActivePreset = \"auto\";\n                SendJsonToWeb(\"preset_switched\", new { preset = \"auto\" });\n            }));\n\n            // Alt+S: Capture Screenshot\n            RegisterAlt(Keys.S, () => Dispatcher.Invoke(() =>\n            {\n                _sessionController.Vision.CaptureScreen();\n                SendJsonToWeb(\"screenshot_queued\", new { count = _sessionController.Vision.QueueCount });\n            }));\n\n            // Alt+P: Process Screenshots with A